SUMMARY: Medusa
DESCRIPTION:A fearless immersive headphone experience that places audienc
 es inside Medusa’s mind.\n\nBefore the serpents\, before the legend\, the
 re was a woman in a world that feared her power. From ancient myth into a
  modern-day Rage Room\, Medusa is a raw\, electrifying story about female
  rage\, power\, and transformation. Through whispered voices and immersiv
 e sound delivered into audience headphones\, you’re drawn directly into M
 edusa’s thoughts as the action unfolds live on stage.\n\nUnflinching\, im
 mersive\, and deeply theatrical\, Medusa reimagines one of Greek mytholog
 y’s most iconic and feared figures in a bold & thrilling new way. It migh
 t just release your inner serpents—or turn you to stone.\n\nWORLD PREMIER
 E
CATEGORIES:theatre,performing-arts
