SUMMARY: Soccer Series
DESCRIPTION:As Toronto gears up to host the world’s biggest sporting even
 t\, ICFF is bringing the energy of the beautiful game to the heart of The
  Distillery Historic District with a celebration of soccer\, cinema\, and
  culture. Kicking off on June 25\, The Distillery Historic District will 
 transform into a cinema and fun event under the stars! As part of the off
 icial selection of movies\, ICFF presents its 'Soccer Series' showcasing 
 a lineup of new releases and fan-favourite classics\, alongside special g
 uests and champions of the game.\n\nFeaturing beloved films like Bend It 
 Like Beckham and Next Goal Wins\, the series celebrates soccer’s global c
 ultural impact while building excitement for the game’s arrival in Toront
 o in 2026.\n\nIndividual tickets are available starting at $22 per screen
 ing. Early Bird 4-Ticket or 6-Ticket bundles offer a 30% discount.\n\n*Ev
 ery individual ticket and ticket package for screenings at the Distillery
  Historic District includes access to a curated food and beverage tasting
  experience throughout the festival village\, featuring partner stations 
 such as Masi Prosecco\, signature festival cocktails\, Lavazza coffee\, a
 nd tastings from Ferrero\, Rio Mare\, Barilla\, and Eataly.
CATEGORIES:ICFF,Soccer,Films,Film-Festival
