SUMMARY: Summer Live Music Series: Kibra
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to groove with Kibra\, a rising R&B and soul artist
  from Toronto whose smooth melodies and powerhouse vocals bring the golde
 n era of Motown and classic soul into the present day. With a sound roote
 d in timeless grooves and heartfelt storytelling\, Kibra takes audiences 
 on a journey through love\, resilience\, and social reflection. Her perfo
 rmance is a tribute to the legends of old school R&B\, infused with a fre
 sh perspective and undeniable soul.
