SUMMARY: Toronto Fringe Launch Party & Artist Parade at Soulpepper Theatr
 e
DESCRIPTION:A procession of Fringe artists in costume and character will 
 parade around the Distillery District to celebrate the start of the festi
 val\, then party the day away with face painting\, photo booth\, tarot re
 adings\, clowns\, music spun by DJ Jean-Paul of Musical Theatre Radio\, a
 nd shave ice courtesy of Man of La Mancha.\n\nThe Artist Parade invites a
 ll Fringe artists to arrive in their “Fringe Best” being costumes from th
 eir shows\, poster boards\, clown noses\, or any creative flair\, and par
 ade through the Distillery District to celebrate the start of the festiva
 l.\n\nClick here to learn more. https://fringetoronto.com/fringe/patio/pr
 ogramming
CATEGORIES:Free-Live-Music,Toronto,Tour,Walking,performing-arts,theatre
