SUMMARY: Summer Live Music Series: Conor Gains & The Canadian Tuxedos
DESCRIPTION:Conor Gains & The Canadian Tuxedos\nConor Gains believes in t
 he knowledge- bearing potential of the open road\, carefully crafting mus
 ic that has landed him in the distinct world of Americana\, Alt Rock & Bl
 ues. With a prolific catalogue of songs that has made its way across fest
 ival stages and halls\, Conor Gains & The Canadian Tuxedos are bringing t
 he ultimate Canada Day party to the Trinity stage! This all-star Canadian
  outfit celebrates the soundtrack of our nation amd delivers a high-energ
 y tribute to the artists and songs that have shaped generations of Canadi
 ans. Grab a drink\, wave a flag\, and get ready to sing along. Canada nev
 er sounded so good.\n\n
