DESCRIPTION:Eunice Keitan is a Malaysian-Canadian Neo-Soul loop artist wh
 o channels the complex feeling of navigating two worlds\, fusing the smoo
 thness of Neo-Soul with evocative\, ancestral Asian soundscapes. Part liv
 e-looping innovator\, part ensemble leader\, she builds lush\, deep\, and
  layered narratives - songs that are emotionally candid about identity an
 d belonging. Her boundary pushing sound has garnered international suppor
 t from BBC Radio\, Stereofox and CBC Music\, drawing sonic comparisons to
