SUMMARY: Scooped by Demetres - National Ice Cream Day
DESCRIPTION:National Ice Cream Day just got sweeter. On July 19\, the fir
 st 100 guests at Scooped by Demetres can enjoy a single scoop for just 19
 ¢ when doors open at 12:00 PM (46 Gristmill Lane\, Toronto\, ON M5A 3C4).
 \n\nWhy 19¢? It’s a nod to a few things they're proud of: their 19% butte
 rfat ice cream (the highest percentage to our knowledge)\, 1989 being whe
 n Demetres was first founded\, and\, by a happy coincidence\, July 19 bei
 ng this year’s National Ice Cream Day.\n\nOffer valid at Scooped Distille
 ry District only. First 100 guests only. Waffle cones\, double scoops\, a
 nd triple scoops are extra. 🍦
