SUMMARY: Roots • Routes
DESCRIPTION:What if your creativity became a product?\nYour sneaker could
  be produced through Reebok.\nYour artwork could become a retail product.
 \nThis is Roots • Routes.\nA three-part creative experience celebrating C
 aribbean creativity while connecting Toronto and Detroit through art\, de
 sign and community.\nCreate.Learn.Present.\nMore than a decade ago\, MART
 KD began in Toronto believing creativity could create opportunity.\nThey 
 are coming home to celebrate their roots at the Distillery District and b
 egin something even bigger.\nTogether\, we're building routes to the worl
 d. Applications are now open\, click here to learn more! https://docs.goo
 gle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScOE183ufx70GbiDwF6mJpOg9ATiQ-zpVZPCUsA7-CZnfhwN
 w/viewform *Must be 21+ to apply. Deadline to apply is July 22nd\, 5pm ES
 T.
