  has performed across major stages including the Toronto Jazz Festival\, 
 Union Summer at Union Station\, and Massey Hall as a guest with Jon Batis
 te. His work blends jazz\, Afro-diasporic music\, hip-hop\, soul\, and co
 mmunity storytelling\, creating high-energy performances rooted in connec
 tion and cultural celebration.
